{
  "slug": "obsidian",
  "name": "Obsidian",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "ntelligent vault assistant for Obsidian via Claude Code. Auto-context, vault intelligence, PKM workflows, and thinking commands.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills** and **5 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `defuddle` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"extract markdown from web page\", \"clean web page…), `json-canvas` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"create a canvas\", \"edit a canvas\", \"obsidian canvas\",…), `obsidian` (Intelligence-first skill for Obsidian vault automation), `obsidian-bases` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"create a base\", \"edit a base\", \"obsidian bases\",…), `obsidian-cli` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"interact with Obsidian vault\", \"manage obsidian notes\", \"search…), `obsidian-markdown` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"create obsidian markdown\", \"edit obsidian markdown\", \"wikilinks\", \"obsidian…), `obsidian-vault-architect` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"vault audit\", \"vault health\", \"vault structure\", \"vault efficiency\",…), `obsidian-workflows` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"morning planning\", \"weekly review\", \"GTD inbox processing\", \"vault…)\n- **Commands** (5): `obsidian-challenge` ((Obsidian) Stress-test a belief using evidence from your vault's own history), `obsidian-connect` ((Obsidian) Find non-obvious connections between two domains in your vault), `obsidian-emerge` ((Obsidian) Surface latent ideas your vault implies but hasn't stated explicitly), `obsidian-trace` ((Obsidian) Trace how thinking on a topic has evolved across your vault), `obsidian` ((Obsidian) Main gateway — auto-routes to vault mode, project mode, or shows quick actions)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install obsidian@claude-community` from `Sourabh-Garg-tech/obsidian`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
